er leave — just like Sammy L Jackson, Cryin’ Chuck Schumer’s lying, fat niece Amy, and all the rest of the sorry-ass Hollywood slaves and attention whores. All they ever do is blow wind about how right they are and how anybody who doesn’t agree with them is a fascist. Nonetheless, if Sammy L Jackson moved to South Africa (as he promised to do) and if Dogg mutt moved to Uganda (as he promised to do), their departure would make the US a far better place.</p>"]]
